    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵapikene yeleyi, ŵandu ŵala ŵabatisidwe mu lina lya Ambuje Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi jele Paulo ŵasajice makono jemanjajo, Msimu Ŵaswela ŵayicilile, nipo ŵatandite kuŵeceta yiŵeceto ya cilendo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ni kulalicila maloŵe ga Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵanduwo ŵaliji ŵakwana likumi ni ŵaŵili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo ŵajinjile m'nyumba ja kupopelela, nipo kwa miesi jitatu ŵaliji mkuŵeceta mwakulimba mtima. Ŵaŵecetaga ni ŵanduwo ya Ucimwene wa Mlungu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ni ŵalingaga kwakopa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo ŵane mwa jemanjajo ŵalimbisye mitima jawo, mpaka nganakulupilila. Nipo pameso pa ŵandu ŵajinji ŵanyosisye ŵakulupilila ŵa Ambujewo. Pelepo Paulo ŵatyocele ŵanduwo ni ŵajigele ŵakulijiganya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵala, nipo lisiku ni lisiku ŵaŵecetanaga msukulu ja Tilano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeleyi yatendecekwe kwa yaka yiŵili, mwakuti ŵandu wosope ŵiŵatamaga ku Asiya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Ayuda ni Agiliki",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " nombe nawo ŵapikene maloŵe ga Ambuje.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ya ŵanace ŵacalume ŵa Sikefa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlungu ŵatesile yakusimonjesya kwejinji kupitila mwa Paulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵajigalaga mipango atamose nguwo sine siŵakamulicisyaga masengo Paulo kwawula nasyo kwa ŵa ku lwala, nipo ŵapolaga soni misimu jakusakala",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jakopokaga mwa jemanjajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵapali Ayuda ŵane ŵiŵajendagajendaga, nipo ŵakoposyaga misimu jakusakala, nombe nawo ŵalingaga kolanga lina lya Ambuje Yesu pa ŵandu ŵiŵakamwilwe ni misimu jakusakalawo. Ŵatiji ku misimu jakusakala jila kuti, “Mu lina lya Yesu jwele Paulo jwakumlalicila, ngumlamula kuti mkopoce.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵiŵatendaga yeleyi ni ŵanace ŵacilume msano ni ŵaŵili ŵa Sikefa, jwamkulungwa jwa ŵakutaga mbopesi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " wosope ŵa Ciyuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo msimu ŵakusakalawo ŵajanjile kuti, “Yesu ngum'manyilila, Paulo soni ngum'manyilila, nambi jemanjamwe ni ŵani?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko mundu juŵakwete misimu jakusakalajo, ŵasumbile ni ŵaputile wosopewo. Mwakuti ŵatisile m'nyumbamo ali matakope nipo ali awulele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu wosope ŵiŵatamaga ku Aefeso, Ayuda ni Agiliki piŵapikene yeleyi, ŵatesile woga. Nipo ŵandu ŵalicimbicisye lina lya Ambuje Yesu mnope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵajinji ŵiŵakulupile, sambano ŵayice kulipeleka soni ni kuyisala yakulemwa yawo yiŵatendaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵiŵatendaga ya matipwi, ŵajigele mabuku gawo ni ŵagaŵisile pampepe ni koca pamoto pameso pa ŵandu wosope. Piŵaŵalasile mtengo wakwe wa mabukugo, wakwanile mbiya 15,000 sya yisyano sya silifa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo maloŵe ga Mlungu gajenele palipose ni kamula masengo mwamacili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Njojo ku Aefeso",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piyamasile yeleyi, Paulo ŵaganisisye ya kwawula ku Yelusalemu kupitila ku Masedoniya ni ku Akaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Ni ŵatite soni kuti, “Kutyocela kweleko tingajawule ku Loma.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo ŵatumisye ŵandu ŵaŵili ŵiŵakamucisyaga, Timoteo ni Elasito, ku Masedoniya. Nambo jwalakwe msyene ŵasigalile ku Asiya kwa masiku gejinji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi jeleji wapali ukangani ŵakogoya mu Aefeso ligongo lya kulupilila Ambuje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "M'misili jwine jwakusakamulisya masengo silifa, lina lyakwe Demetiliyo, ŵapanganyaga yiboliboli ni silifa yiŵaŵikaga mu nyumba ja kupopelela ja mlungu jwamkongwe Alitemisi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Nipo masengo gakwego gapatisyaga mbiya syejinji ŵamasengo ŵakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Demetiliyo ŵaŵilasile ŵamasengo ŵakwe wosope pamo, pampepe ni acimjakwe ŵiŵatendaga masengo gagogo, ni ŵatite kuti, “Acimjangu, mkumanyilila kuti cipanje cetuwe cikutyocela m'masengo gelega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano ngati ayiweni ni kupikana yele yakutenda aju munduju, Paulo. Jweleju akuŵeceta kuti milungu jakupanganya ŵandu nganijiŵa milungu kose. Nipo ŵandu ŵajinji ampikanile mu Aefeso muno mpaka cilambo cosope ca Asiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano cakogoya mnope ni cakuti malonda getu tigaŵe gakunyosyeka. Nambo soni nyumba jakupopelela mlungu jwetu jwamkulungwa Alitemisi, ŵandu ngasajicimbicisya kose, soni ukulungwa wakwe tiwumale, jwele ŵandu wosope ŵa ku Asiya ni ŵa pa cilambo cosope capasi ŵamlumbaga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵapikene ŵandu ŵala gele maloŵega, ŵatumbile mnope, ni ŵatandite gumila kuti, “Jwamkulungwa nijo Alitemisi jwa ku Aefeso!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo msinda wosope wagumbele ni cisokonesyo. Mpaka ŵandu ŵamkamwile Gayo ni Alisitaliko, ŵandu ŵaŵili ŵa ku Masedoniya, ŵiŵajendaga ni Paulo, ni ŵapite nawo ku luŵala lwa ung'asi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paulo msyene ŵasakaga kwawula kwa ŵanduwo, nambo ŵakulijiganya ŵala ŵamkanyisye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acakulungwa ŵane ŵa ulamusi, acimjawo ŵa Paulo ŵamtumicisye maloŵe kumŵenda kuti akasajawula ku luŵalako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msonganowo wasokonecele ligongo ŵandu ŵagumililaga yindu yakulekangana, ŵane yawo ni ŵane soni yawo. Mwakuti ŵandu ŵajinji nganamanyililaga ligongo liŵajawulile ku luŵalako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵane mwa ŵanduwo ŵaganisyaga kuti Alekisanda ni ŵayikwakwaya, ligongo Ayuda ŵamŵisile pasogolo jwalakwe pa ŵanduwo. Kaneko Alekisanda ŵakwesisye mkono ŵakwe mwinani kuti ŵandu atame jii, ni ŵatandite kuŵeceta mwakulicenjela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo ŵanduwo piŵamanyilile kuti jwalakwe ni Myuda, wosope ŵagumisile pampepe kwa ma awala gaŵili acitiji, “Jwamkulungwa ni Alitemisi jwa kwa Aefeso!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakumalisya pakwe, jwakulembela jwa mu msindamo ŵakombwele kwatamika ŵandu ŵala jii. Ni ŵatite, “Acimjangu ŵa ku Aefeso kuno, jwalijose akumanyilila kuti msinda wa Aefeso uno ni wele ukusunga nyumba jakupopelela Alitemisi, mlungu jwamkulungwa pampepe ni liganga lya ulemu lilyagwile kutyocela kwinani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano pakuti pangali mundu jwampaka asisye yeleyi, myoyo jemanja mtame jii mkatenda yindu mwakuloŵela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanja myice nawo ŵandu aŵa akuno, soni nganajiŵa yindu ya m'nyumba jakupopelela kapena kumnyosya mlungu jwetu jwamkongwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naga Demetiliyo ni amisili acimjakwe akwete kandu ni mundu jwine, nganya sya magambo sipali, nipo ŵakuŵeceta magambo apali soni. Ni kweleko takaŵecetele magambo gawogo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naga mkwete kandu kane kamkusaka, keleko tikacilamulidwa ni nganya jajikulungwa ja ŵandu wosope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ligongo lya yindu yitendekwe leloyi yili yakogoya yakuti uwe mpaka atujimbe magambo. Pangali ligongo lya njojo situtesilesi, nipo soni tukasoŵe yakuŵeceta naga akatuwusye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 19:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵamasile kuŵeceta yeleyi, ŵasalile ŵandu ŵala kuti ajawulanganeje.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.19.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.19.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
